  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AkRvhGp.png\" alt=\"鹽\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Salt 增加了食物鹽漬機制，以及多種其他功能和方塊。</span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7qubYox.png\" alt=\"鹽漬\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzyoTBf.png\" alt=\"取得\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/088PZL6.png\" alt=\"其他\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支援食物鹽漬的模組列表：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Farmer's Delight</span></strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-delight-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Miner's Delight</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/butchercraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Butchercraft</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Croptopia</strong></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-depths-upgrade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Nether Depths Upgrade</strong></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他可透過<strong>資料包</strong>或<strong>KubeJS</strong>新增。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持能讓我持續開發它及其他模組！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
